wnload Notebook\">.ipynb</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n\n<!-- Card 05 -->\n<article class=\"hub-card\">\n<div class=\"hub-card-body\">\n<div class=\"hub-card-kicker\">Lecture 05 · Geometric Mechanics</div>\n<h3 class=\"hub-card-title\">Nonlinear ODEs in Mechanics: Phase Space & Pendulum</h3>\n<p class=\"hub-card-abstract\">Formulate nonlinear conservative dynamics beyond small angles. Construct the exact phase portrait, homoclinic separatrix orbit, and elliptic period elongation.</p>\n<div class=\"hub-card-tags\">\n<span class=\"hub-tag\">#NonlinearODEs</span>\n<span class=\"hub-tag\">#PhaseSpace</span>\n<span class=\"hub-tag\">#EnergyConservation</span>\n<span class=\"hub-tag\">#Separatrix</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hub-card-footer\">\n<a href=\"./lectures/05-nonlinear-odes/index.html\" class=\"hub-card-link\">Open interactive tutorial ↗</a>\n<div class=\"hub-card-downloads\">\n<a href=\"./lectures/05-nonlinear-odes/slides.pdf\" download title=\"Download Slides PDF\">PDF</a> · \n<a href=\"./lectures/05-nonlinear-odes/notebook.ipynb\" download title=\"Download Notebook\">.ipynb</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n\n<!-- Card 06 -->\n<article class=\"hub-card\">\n<div class=\"hub-card-body\">\n<div class=\"hub-card-kicker\">Lecture 06 · Stability Theory</div>\n<h3 class=\"hub-card-title\">Phase Portraits & Stability Analysis: Limit Cycles</h3>\n<p class=\"hub-card-abstract\">Locate equilibrium points and classify stability via the trace-determinant plane of the Jacobian matrix. Map invariant manifolds and Van der Pol limit cycles.</p>\n<div class=\"hub-card-tags\">\n<span class=\"hub-tag\">#PhasePortraits</span>\n<span class=\"hub-tag\">#Stability</span>\n<span class=\"hub-tag\">#Jacobian</span>\n<span class=\"hub-tag\">#LimitCycles</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hub-card-footer\">\n<a href=\"./lectures/06-phase-portraits-stability/index.html\" class=\"hub-card-link\">Open interactive tutorial ↗</a>\n<div class=\"hub-card-downloads\">\n<a href=\"./lectures/06-phase-portraits-stability/slides.pdf\" download title=\"Download Slides PDF\">PDF</a> · \n<a href=\"./lectures/06-phase-portraits-stability/notebook.ipynb\" download title=\"Download Notebook\">.ipynb</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n\n<!-- Card 07 -->\n<article class=\"hub-card\">\n<div class=\"hub-card-body\">\n<div class=\"hub-card-kicker\">Lecture 07 · Computational Mechanics</div>\n<h3 class=\"hub-card-title\">Numerical Solution of ODEs: Runge-Kutta & Stiffness</h3>\n<p class=\"hub-card-abstract\">Explicit and implicit Runge-Kutta integrators. Derive the Butcher tableau, map Dahlquist complex stability boundaries, and diagnose numerical stiffness.</p>\n<div class=\"hub-card-tags\">\n<span class=\"hub-tag\">#RungeKutta</span>\n<span class=\"hub-tag\">#DahlquistStability</span>\n<span class=\"hub-tag\">#Stiffness</span>\n<span class=\"hub-tag\">#AdaptiveStep</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hub-card-footer\">\n<a href=\"./lectures/07-numerical-odes/index.html\" class=\"hub-card-link\">Open interactive tutorial ↗</a>\n<div class=\"hub-card-downloads\">\n<a href=\"./lectures/07-numerical-odes/slides.pdf\" download title=\"Download Slides PDF\">PDF</a> · \n<a href=\"./lectures/07-numerical-odes/notebook.ipynb\" download title=\"Download Notebook\">.ipynb</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n\n</div>\n</main>\n\n<footer class=\"footer-band\">\n<div class=\"footer-inner\">\n<div class=\"footer-info\">\n<div class=\"footer-brand-title\">Data-Driven Modelling for Mechanical Systems</div>\n<div>Graduate Mechanical Engineering & Scientific Computing</div>\n<div>Pure Quarto Website · Hosted on GitHub Pages</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer-links\">\n<div><strong>Quick Navigation</strong></div>\n<div><a href=\"./index.html\">All Tutorials Hub</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</footer>\n```\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n<div class=\"topbar-inner\">\n<a href=\"./index.html\" class=\"brand\">\n<div class=\"brand-mark\">ω</div>\n<div cla